invalid type: string "Old Bank Shopping Arcade in Wellington City is a small upmarket arcade in the former Bank of New Zealand headquarters. Has an animated musical clock which performs on the hour, and a small display on the remains of a boat washed up here in 1855.\nQueensgate Shopping Centre in Lower Hutt Central is the largest shopping mall in the Lower North Island.", expected a booleanÿÿÿÿÿÿ